      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "It is submitted that victim solemnized her marriage with petitioner out of her own sweet will and they were leading their conjugal life happily.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1887,
      "end": 2031,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "It is submitted Rohit Kumar Yadav vs The State Of Bihar on 22 March, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/138509621/\n1",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2032,
      "end": 2162,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rohit Kumar Yadav vs The State Of Bihar",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 2048,
          "end": 2087
        },
        {
          "text": "22 March, 2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2091,
          "end": 2105
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "that allegation, as regard to kidnap and sexual assault, is not available against this petitioner, as per statement of the victim recorded under Section 164 of the Cr.P.C.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2163,
      "end": 2334,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 164",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2308,
          "end": 2319
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2327,
          "end": 2334
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "While concluding the argument it has been submitted that petitioner is a man of clean antecedent and moreover, investigation of this case is completed, for which, charge-sheet has been submitted and, as such, there is no chance of tampering with the evidence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2335,
      "end": 2594,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "Learned APP for the State opposes the prayer of bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2596,
      "end": 2649,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "Considering the facts and circumstances as mentioned above, as allegation of rape and sexual assault is not available against this petitioner,\nwhere it appears that victim solemnized her marriage with this petitioner out of her own sweet will coupled with the fact that charge-sheet has been submitted, let the petitioner, above named, is directed to be released on bail in connection with Sabour P.S. Case No. 111 of 2022 on furnishing Patna High Court CR.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2650,
      "end": 3107,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sabour P.S. Case No. 111 of 2022",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 3040,
          "end": 3072
        },
        {
          "text": "Patna High Court",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 3087,
          "end": 3103
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "MISC. No.74067 of 2022(2) dt.22-03-2023 bail bond of Rs.10,000/- (Rupees Ten Thousand) with two sureties of the like amount each to the satisfaction of learned Additional District and Sessions Judge 6th -cum-Exclusive Special Judge POCSO, Bhagalpur/concerned Court,",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 3108,
      "end": 3373,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "MISC. No.74067 of 2022(2)",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
